<title>GERMANY: HypoBank 96 net income per share rises.</title>
<headline>HypoBank 96 net income per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>    Net income per share			2.60   vs 2.57 dmk</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank AG. The figure was released at its annual news conference.</p>
